    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AgentProcure - intake & approvals\n1. A form / email client POSTs `{email, subject, text, scenario_id}` to the first webhook.\n2. The Procurement Analyst agent triages it; incomplete requests get an auto-reply.\n3. Complete requests start a LangGraph case: policy -> CrewAI sourcing crew -> pauses for the human approver.\n4. The approver gets an e-mail with APPROVE / REJECT links (second webhook) which resume the graph.\n5. Every case and decision is logged to Google Sheets.\n\nSet the values in **Config** and attach SMTP + Google Sheets credentials.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "f809c577-320c-4d40-8d0c-be3e739f83ca",
      "name": "Sticky: how it works",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -60
      ]
    }
